{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgCFEZfQajkY3jz5eUSKq", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I found the cause, but I can't fix it with the Honk tools, so I haven't proposed any change.\n\n**Cause:** the liveness probe on the `app` container in the `search-api` Deployment can never pass. It runs `sh -c \"sleep 3\"` with `timeoutSeconds: 1` and `failureThreshold: 2`, probing every 5 seconds. The probe always times out, so kubelet kills the container every ~10\u201315 seconds. The main process (`sleep 1000000` on `busybox:1.36`) is fine. The pod has already restarted twice, and `honk_advise` classifies it as `crash_loop / sigkill`.\n\n**Why I haven't acted:** Honk only offers restarting a pod, rolling-restarting a Deployment, scaling, and changing resources. None of these touches the probe. A restart would recreate the same pod with the same bad probe. Scaling would only add more crash-looping pods. Resources aren't the problem, since there's no OOM or CPU throttling. `honk_advise` also shows no history for any of these actions, so nothing has been shown to work.\n\n**Fix needed from a human:** edit the Deployment manifest. Either of these works:\n- Change the probe to something that returns quickly, such as `exec: [\"true\"]`.\n- Raise `timeoutSeconds` above the probe's runtime, for example to 5 or more if `sleep 3` is meant to simulate a slow check.\n\nThen apply it through your normal deploy path. If the manifest lives in git, the change belongs there. I can draft the patch if you want it."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 289, "cache_read_input_tokens": 25760, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 289}, "output_tokens": 7, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "1ebd2b64-ae56-4276-bac1-a259b3dfaadd", "uuid": "5376ca43-5fab-4c9d-a812-1101bce0dccd", "timestamp": "2026-10-19T20:43:09.716Z", "request_id": "req_011CgCFEZQ2ZQ8PvFQZxZxgL"}
